#: aguard-safe.php:447
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr ""

#: aguard-safe.php:448
msgid "This site uses the AGuard Safe security plugin to notice break-ins. The plugin keeps a log of sign-ins, failed sign-in attempts and administrative actions, together with the IP address and the browser name of whoever made them. It also notes requests that look like a search for a weak spot (for example, for a backup of the configuration file), with the IP address and the browser name. The records are stored on this site, sign-ins and actions for 90 days and such requests for 30 days, and are not shared with anyone."
msgstr ""

#: aguard-safe.php:450
msgid "The plugin also uses a service run by its author, AGuard (data.aguard.lt):"
